OL,3,AMore than 850,000 without power after
OL,4,AHurricane Isaias makes landfall in
OL,5,AFlorida
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 850,000 properties are
OL,8,Fwithout power across Alabama, Georgia
OL,9,Fand Florida after Hurricane Isaias made
OL,10,Flandfall on Friday
OL,12,FIt made landfall near Destin, Florida,
OL,13,Fand is expected to cross Alabama into
OL,14,Fthe Tennessee Valley over the coming
OL,15,Fdays - images show houses battered by
OL,16,Fwinds and felled trees
OL,18,FIsaias peaked as a category three
OL,19,Fhurricane, bringing with it heavy rain
OL,20,Fand powerful wind, but has since been
OL,21,Fdowngraded
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
