OL,3,AMore than 850,000 without power after
OL,4,AHurricane Isaias makes landfall in
OL,5,AFlorida
OL,6,
OL,7,FA state of emergency has been issued in
OL,8,Fall three US states and one woman has
OL,9,Fbeen killed after a tree fell on a
OL,10,Fhouse in Florida, the Escambia County
OL,11,Fsheriff says
OL,13,FFlorida Governor Ron DeSantis says it
OL,14,Fis "still a very hazardous situation"
OL,15,Fand the threat of flooding remains
OL,17,FIn addition to Isaias, Tropical Storm
OL,18,FRachel will impact southern California
OL,19,Fon Saturday, and Hurricane Simon will
OL,20,Fhit the Pacific coast of Mexico on
OL,21,FSunday
